# item95: `ULevel::FindSpot` now adjusts the post-lever cine's `tp 23` `SetLocation` into a free
# spot, so Carrington reaches `PositionInfo23` (the platform), the cine passes `wait player 128`,
# fires `Event Wave01 Wave02` (tabActions[63]) and parks at `wait event RushFinalCine`
# (tabActions[71]). `GenNMI6`/`GenNMI7` spawn `BaseSoldier6`/`BaseSoldier7` at t=520.4. The route
# tracks `BaseSoldier7` at t=520.5 (head band, 0.90) and fires from t=520.6 every 0.1 s, killing it
# before its shotgun burst, so the player survives the wave at 10 hp. item95d: the collision
# changes since item95 (item91's mesh/mover sweeps) clear the firing lane only at ~522.5 s; the
# original 0.2 s cadence killed the soldier at 523.6, after it had fired twice, so the cadence is
# doubled (input only). `BaseSoldier6` holds position in its controller's `Tenir` state at
# (-18,-710,102) and never engages, so its `RushFinal` event never fires; `CineTrigger1`
# (counter 2) never reaches zero and `wait event RushFinalCine` cannot pass. This is the pinned
# next blocker: goal 5 and the Hual04c travel stay unreached.
